{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-119","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-tourn-119"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-talk-403816550-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-119","missionId":"event-tourn-119","mission":"벼룩시장","scene":"벼룩시장","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 부서진 기억 거품 속에 있다. 한 앰버기원에 한 번 열리는 천성 벼룩시장은 최근 가장 인기 있는 시기에 들어섰다. 이곳에서는 더 이상 홀로그램 선반이나 신용 포인트가 필요하지 않으며, 마음에 드는 물건이 있다면 물물교환이 가능하다","talkId":403816550,"textHash":"6377036661086947314","source":"tournHandBookEvent:119/talk-403816550","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3f6db57d3aceb19e","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-talk-403816551-line"],"bwikiPage":"跳蚤市场","bwikiRevision":97790,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13808","bwikiMission":"벼룩시장"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-talk-403816551-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-119","missionId":"event-tourn-119","mission":"벼룩시장","scene":"벼룩시장","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"천지를 뒤덮은 선박이 정박하기도 전에 주인이 바뀌었다. 항상 단정한 모습을 보이던 브레타드인도 정신없이 교환할 상품을 찾는다","talkId":403816551,"textHash":"6500844655889624716","source":"tournHandBookEvent:119/talk-403816551","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3f6db57d3aceb19e","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-talk-403816552-line"],"bwikiPage":"跳蚤市场","bwikiRevision":97790,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13808","bwikiMission":"벼룩시장"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-talk-403816552-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-119","missionId":"event-tourn-119","mission":"벼룩시장","scene":"벼룩시장","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 수염이 덥수룩한 음유시인을 만났다. 그는 당신에게 은하의 기억이 가득 담긴 오래된 자루를 보여주었다","talkId":403816552,"textHash":"278292733933864038","source":"tournHandBookEvent:119/talk-403816552","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3f6db57d3aceb19e","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-talk-403816553-line"],"bwikiPage":"跳蚤市场","bwikiRevision":97790,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13808","bwikiMission":"벼룩시장"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-talk-403816553-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-119","missionId":"event-tourn-119","mission":"벼룩시장","scene":"벼룩시장","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「이야기, 이야기를 하나 들려주세요. 진짜든 가짜든 상관없습니다」 음유시인이 말했다. 「그러면 저는 당신의 시를 가져가겠습니다. 당신은 제 노래를 가져가세요」","talkId":403816553,"textHash":"9359200506621975880","source":"tournHandBookEvent:119/talk-403816553","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3f6db57d3aceb19e","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"跳蚤市场","bwikiRevision":97790,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13808","bwikiMission":"벼룩시장"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-text-1869401699070440945-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-119","missionId":"event-tourn-119","mission":"벼룩시장","scene":"벼룩시장","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"다채로운 여행 이야기를 한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"1869401699070440945","source":"tournHandBookEvent:119/text-1869401699070440945","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"feed617e22080f74","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-text-11305856290418073952-effect"],"bwikiPage":"跳蚤市场","bwikiRevision":97790,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13808","bwikiMission":"벼룩시장"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-text-11305856290418073952-effect","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-119","missionId":"event-tourn-119","mission":"벼룩시장","scene":"벼룩시장","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"축복을 제출한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"11305856290418073952","source":"tournHandBookEvent:119/text-11305856290418073952","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"feed617e22080f74","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"跳蚤市场","